        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 3252, 48 Inch Satin Copper Rectangular Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA, the 48 Inch Satin Copper Rectangular Pull was designed by First Impressions International, the leader in innovative pull concepts. It is 4 feet in length with a beautiful satin copper finish. It comes with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 3252 48 Inch Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thru-bolt mounting (Bolts through the door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
